<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3967270); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967270&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606619236" alt="Dr Aral See" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967270)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3967270); return false;">Dr Aral See</a></span></p>
